validationEnabled|BOOLEAN|true|Payload format and semantic validation (B4).

conflictEnabled|BOOLEAN|true|Cross-tenant conflict and spoofing detection (B5).

adaptiveEnabled|BOOLEAN|true|Adaptive throttling based on a decaying violation score (B6).

auditEnabled|BOOLEAN|true|Bypass auditor: flag flows/intents that did not come through the gateway (B7).

auditAllowedApps|STRING|org.onosproject.core|Comma-separated non-tenant appIds whose flows/intents are legitimate (B7).

