serviceAccountPassword|STRING|gw-svc-pw|Password of the viewer-only read-forwarding account (user name from tenants.json).

rateLimitRps|DOUBLE|10.0|Token refill rate per tenant in requests (tokens) per second (B2).

rateLimitBurst|INTEGER|20|Token bucket capacity per tenant (B2).

maxBatchSize|INTEGER|50|Max flows per POST/DELETE /gw/flows batch, checked before decoding (B2).

maxBodyBytes|INTEGER|65536|Max request body size in bytes, checked before parsing (B2).

maxFlowsPerTenant|INTEGER|100|Default max flows per tenant (direct + intent-compiled) (B3).

maxFlowsPerTenantPerDevice|INTEGER|40|Default max flows per tenant on one device (B3).

maxIntentsPerTenant|INTEGER|20|Default max intents per tenant (B3).

churnLimit|INTEGER|200|Default max flow/intent add+delete operations per churn window (B3).

churnWindowSeconds|INTEGER|60|Length of the sliding churn window in seconds (B3).

minPriority|INTEGER|100|Lowest priority of a tenant flow/intent (B4).

maxPriority|INTEGER|30000|Highest priority of a tenant flow/intent; above it the core apps' range (B4).

maxTimeout|INTEGER|300|Longest flow timeout in seconds; permanent flows are never allowed (B4).

throttleMode|STRING|adaptive|B6 policy: adaptive (levels) or fixed (Lab2: any violation blocks writes for fixedPenaltySeconds).

scoreHalfLife|DOUBLE|60.0|Half-life of the violation score in seconds (B6).

level1Threshold|DOUBLE|10.0|Score at which a tenant becomes Restricted (B6 level 1).

level2Threshold|DOUBLE|25.0|Score at which a tenant enters Cooldown (B6 level 2).

level3Threshold|DOUBLE|50.0|Score at which a tenant is Blocked (B6 level 3).

restrictedRateFactor|DOUBLE|0.5|Refill-rate factor of the B2 bucket at level 1 and above (B6).

cooldown|INTEGER|30|Cooldown (writes 429) in seconds on entering level 2; doubles on re-entry (B6).

cooldownMax|INTEGER|960|Cap of the doubling cooldown in seconds (B6).

fixedPenalty|INTEGER|60|Fixed-mode write block in seconds after any violation (B6, Lab2 comparison).

fixedEffect|STRING|rate|Fixed-mode effect: rate (refill rate x fixedRateFactor on all requests) or block-writes (B6).

fixedRateFactor|DOUBLE|0.1|Refill-rate factor during a fixed-mode penalty with fixedEffect=rate (B6).

weightRateLimit|DOUBLE|1.0|Score added per rate-limit rejection (B6).

weightQuota|DOUBLE|2.0|Score added per quota rejection (B6).

weightValidation|DOUBLE|3.0|Score added per validation rejection (B6).

weightConflict|DOUBLE|5.0|Score added per conflict/spoofing rejection (B6).

weightAcl|DOUBLE|3.0|Score added per ACL/ownership rejection (B6).

